:: Misland Rape
You wake up under assault by a beast! 
<br><br>
<<if $islanddistance lt 30>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 ant>>
	<!-- Modified for monster people -->
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from the sand, gnashing its teeth.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Invader," <<bhe>> cackles. "Mine."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Misland Ant]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $islanddistance lte 70>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 wolf>>
	<!-- Modified for monster people -->
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from between the trees, teeth bared.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Found you," <<bhe>> barks. "Mine."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Misland Wolf]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 bear>>
