:: Pruti Sendoff
<<npc "Pruti">>
Pruti sees you eyeing the door and sighs annoyed. "You do want to leave don't you?" <<bHe>> grumbles. "Look I don't usually do this... but I could free you from this vessel and let you go." <<bHe>> seems to be having a hard time getting <<bhis>> words out. "Well, what I mean is I usually don't let my tools go but as long as you come back I wouldn't... exactly be against it." <<bHe>> hesitates for a moment before striking you with <<bhis>> tendril, extracting your soul from the doll. "Leave now. Before I change my mind."
<br><br>
<<if $bodyless is 1>>
